# Shrimp Spicy Rolls

Based on [http://fromgatetoplate.com/2014/04/14/…](http://fromgatetoplate.com/2014/04/14/spicy-shrimp-sushi-rolls) ([wayback](https://web.archive.org/web/20140814022520/http://fromgatetoplate.com/2014/04/14/spicy-shrimp-sushi-rolls))

{ rating="3" image="shrimp_spicy_rolls.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] [cooked shrimp]{ ing="cooked-shrimp" }, chopped
- [ ] [cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" }
- [ ] [mayo]{ ing="mayo" }
- [ ] [Sriracha]{ ing="sriracha" }
- [ ] [sushi rice]{ ing="sushi-rice" }
- [ ] [wasabi]{ ing="wasabi" }
- [ ] [nori]{ ing="nori" }

## Recipe

1. Cut the [Nori]{ ing="nori" } sheet in half. Spread [rice]{ ing="sushi-rice" } over the nori, then flip rice side down
1. Add the fillings and roll. Drizzle with extra spicy [mayo]{ ing="mayo" } sauce on top
